  "description_html": "Extremely speculative life restoration of the otodontid shark <i>Megalolamna paradoxodon</i>.\n<p><b>References:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><cite style=\"font-style:normal\"> (2016). \"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/308795125_A_new_elusive_otodontid_shark_Lamniformes_Otodontidae_from_the_lower_Miocene_and_comments_on_the_taxonomy_of_otodontid_genera_including_the_'megatoothed'_clade%7Clast1=Shimada%7Cfirst1=Kenshu%7Clast2=Chandler%7Cfirst2=Richard\">E. A new elusive otodontid shark (Lamniformes: Otodontidae) from the lower Miocene, and comments on the taxonomy of otodontid genera, including the 'megatoothed' clade</a>\". <i>Historical Biology</i> <b>2</b> (5): 704-714.</cite></li>\n<li>Appearance based on <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cretolamna.jpg\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"File:Cretolamna.jpg\"><i>Cretolamna</i> sp.</a>, <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Isurus_oxyrhynchus&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Isurus oxyrhynchus (page does not exist)\">Isurus oxyrhynchus</a></i>, and <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Odontaspis_ferox&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Odontaspis ferox (page does not exist)\">Odontaspis ferox</a></i>.</li></ul>",
